FUNCTION HTTPGETFILE(URL, PATH)
* mvx-lang/curl — download URL to PATH via libcurl through CallC (CURLGETFILE),
* returning the HTTP status (-1 transport error, -2 cannot open PATH).  -L/redirect
* and binary handling are libcurl's; a GitHub release URL 302s to the CDN.
* GPL-2.0-only.
   PERFORM "UDT.OPTIONS 88 ON"        ;* enable CallC
   CODE = CALLC CURLGETFILE(URL, PATH)
   RETURN CODE + 0
